Debut EP "Gray Morrison"
Recorded between March and December 2025, this collection was born from a time of upheaval, capturing the fragile balance between darkness and hope. Each track reaches toward meaning, connection, and the possibility of redemption, or the quiet acceptance of closure. Morrison is joined by Joanne Rowland on vocals, longtime school friend Rosie Marc (Jayne Harkness, formerly of Vokxen) on drums, David Jamison (formerly of Clay) on drums and percussion, and a guest performance from Michael Sidwell (of Leithinis) on keyboards. Recorded, mixed, and mastered by David Jamison at Millstone Studios, County Down, Northern Ireland.
